    {
      "n": 6,
      "title": "Motivation",
      "days": [
        {
          "day": 8,
          "title": "Motivation Mapping",
          "kind": "learning",
          "declaredBlocks": 5,
          "subtitle": "Why some tasks wait.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "n": 1,
              "title": "Welcome Back!",
              "type": "quiz",
              "interaction": "single-select",
              "key": "reset_feel",
              "minutes": 1,
              "body": [],
              "notes": [],
              "prompt": "How did your reset go?",
              "options": [
                "Calmer",
                "More focused",
                "More energetic",
                "No different",
                "Didn't get to it"
              ]
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "title": "Motivation",
              "type": "lesson",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": [
                {
                  "kind": "p",
                  "text": "We put a task off when it feels costly now and pays off later. Four things decide it."
                },
                {
                  "kind": "p",
                  "text": "Roadblock: what stops you from starting, like not knowing the first step, fear of doing it badly, or it being boring. Reward: what you get once it's done. Urgency: how soon it actually matters. Time gap: how long between doing the work and feeling the reward."
                },
                {
                  "kind": "p",
                  "text": "The longer the time gap and the lower the urgency, the easier it is to put off. Naming them makes the task smaller."
                }
              ],
              "notes": []
            },
            {
              "n": 3,
              "title": "Putting It Off",
              "type": "exercise",
              "interaction": "input-table",
              "key": "putting_off",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": [],
              "notes": [],
              "prompt": "Which of these have you been putting off?"
            },
            {
              "n": 4,
              "title": "Motivation Map",
              "type": "exercise",
              "interaction": "input-table",
              "key": "motivation_map",
              "minutes": 5,
              "body": [],
              "notes": [],
              "prompt": "Map each task you've been putting off."
            },
            {
              "n": 5,
              "title": "Conclusion",
              "type": "conclude",
              "minutes": 1,
              "body": [
                {
                  "kind": "p",
                  "text": "Now you know what's in the way. Tomorrow we take one of these on."
                }
              ],
              "notes": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
